# Scooped! (windurst 38): Naiko-Paneiko and Chyuk-Kochak in Windurst Waters. Making Headlines accepted by GM (not
# completed: not available; Naiko's script answers it with a reminder, a random one of 666 / 671; a trade: nothing),
# then completed by GM: the trade while the check holds (nothing), 676 (begun), 677 and the script's turn (663), 679,
# the trades (a chip; the box and a chip: nil; the Bronze Box: 680, completed: fame +20, 1500 gil, the box taken), 663
# and 682 (replaceDefault), and a trade while completed (nothing).
# Defaults: Naiko-Paneiko's script: Making Headlines available 665 (its finish adds that quest), accepted reminders
# (666 / 671 by math.randomInt, until the scoops are in), completed 663; it has no onTrade. Chyuk-Kochak 664 (no
# script). The lookup alternates Naiko's Event / replaceDefault lines with his script; Progress lines win. Also named:
# Naiko-Paneiko by LB04 (accepted only) and The Weekly Adventurer (Windurst Waters [S]'s Naiko-Paneiko); Chyuk-Kochak by
# no other quest.
lists WindurstWaters/Naiko-Paneiko/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Naiko-Paneiko/onTrade WindurstWaters/Chyuk-Kochak/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/676 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/680
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-246.9,-5.31,-306.0
quest Windurst.MakingHeadlines accepted
item BronzeBox
item BoneChip
login
trade Naiko-Paneiko BronzeBox x1                    # Making Headlines not completed: no section, no script onTrade: nothing
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # not available: his script's Making Headlines reminder (666 or 671)
finish
quest Windurst.MakingHeadlines completed
walk -246.9,-5.31,-306.0
trade Naiko-Paneiko BronzeBox x1                    # available: no trade handler in section 1, nothing
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # available: progressEvent 676
finish                                              # begun
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # accepted: event 677 (the handler's turn)
finish
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # the script's turn: Making Headlines completed, 663
finish
trigger Chyuk-Kochak                                # accepted: event 679
finish
walk -246.9,-5.31,-306.0
trade Naiko-Paneiko BoneChip x1                     # not the box: nil
trade Naiko-Paneiko BronzeBox x1 BoneChip x1        # the box and a chip: not exact, nil
trade Naiko-Paneiko BronzeBox x1                    # the box: progressEvent 680
finish                                              # the box taken; completed: fame +20, 1500 gil
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # completed: 663 (replaceDefault, the handler's turn)
finish
trigger Naiko-Paneiko                               # the script's turn: 663
finish
trigger Chyuk-Kochak                                # completed: 682 (replaceDefault)
finish
walk -246.9,-5.31,-306.0
trade Naiko-Paneiko BoneChip x1                     # completed: no trade handler, nothing
